					"content": "已經全部趕走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721260303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721260303,
					"content": "謝謝您，這樣我就能繼續種花了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721260304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉名山薰"
				},
				{
					"id": 721260304,
					"content": "啊，對了，這些東西請您收下，我也沒什麼好東西給您…總之，謝謝您願意幫我的忙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "葉名山薰"
				}
